{"seq":3,"slug":"sampling-cardinality","title":"采样、基数与成本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/event-pipeline/sampling-cardinality","wordCount":2582,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"采样-基数与成本控制\">采样、基数与成本控制</h1><p>一次搜索会话产生的曝光事件量级是这次会话产生订单量级的一百到一千倍：用户滚动五屏、每屏十张卡片、来回切换筛选条件，就能产生几百条曝光记录，而这个会话可能最终一单不下。当平台每天有千万级搜索会话时，全量采集与存储这些事件的成本会超过搜索系统本身的运行成本。控制成本的手段只有三个：采样、去重、降基数。它们各自有精度代价，代价的分布决定了哪些指标还能用、哪些不能用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成本公式与三个控制点\">核心概念：成本公式与三个控制点</h2><p>先写出成本的结构，才能知道削哪里。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>events</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ingest</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>storage</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>retention</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>events</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>compute</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx N_{\\text{events}} \\times \\left(c_{\\text{ingest}} + c_{\\text{storage}} \\times T_{\\text{retention}}\\right) + N_{\\text{events}} \\times c_{\\text{compute}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">events</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ingest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">storage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retention</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">events</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>events</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{events}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">events</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是事件条数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>retention</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{retention}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retention</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是保留期。三个可调项：<strong>事件条数</strong>（采样与去重）、<strong>单事件成本</strong>（字段精简、压缩、列式存储）、<strong>保留期</strong>（分层保留）。经验上事件条数是最大的杠杆，因此采样是主战场。</p>\n<p>但采样的代价不是均匀的。考虑一个指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = a/b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（例如 CTR），对事件做概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的均匀采样后，分子分母同步缩小，点估计<strong>无偏</strong>，而方差变为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(r) \\approx \\frac{r(1-r)}{b \\cdot p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，采样把分母的有效样本量降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\cdot p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。对于高基数的头部指标（CTR 的分母是几亿次曝光），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 仍然有百万级样本，完全够用。但对于<strong>小比率指标</strong>（零结果率、某个市场的某个新品类），分母本来就小，再乘 0.01 就只剩噪声。这解释了为什么「能不能采样」的答案是分指标而定的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标类型</th>\n<th>典型分母量级</th>\n<th>可承受采样率</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局 CTR/CVR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1%~5%</td>\n<td>分母巨大，方差仍小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分市场分品类 CTR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>10%~50%</td>\n<td>分母中等，需保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果率（分市场）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>100% 或按查询分层</td>\n<td>分母小且需要看长尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾查询簇指标</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>100%（长尾全量）</td>\n<td>再采样就归零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验组间差异</td>\n<td>依实验流量</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../experiment-feedback/search-ab-metrics\">搜索 A/B 的指标与显著性</a></td>\n<td>采样会直接降低检验功效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层采样-让采样率随需求变化\">分层采样：让采样率随需求变化</h2><p>均匀采样是为全局指标优化的，对长尾是灾难。分层采样把事件按「需求强度」分桶，各桶用不同采样率。</p>\n<p><strong>按查询频次分层。</strong> 头部查询（日搜索量 &gt; 阈值）用低采样率；尾部查询（日搜索量 &lt; 阈值）用 100%。这样头部指标仍然有充足样本，而长尾查询簇的需求分析（见 <a href=\"../query-product-insights/query-demand-analysis\">查询需求/缺口/趋势分析</a>）不会因为采样而丢失簇。实现上需要在查询侧维护一个「查询频次分档」维表，并在采集网关或流处理里做分档判定。</p>\n<p><strong>按事件类型分层。</strong> 曝光量最大且对精度要求相对宽松，可以重采样；点击量小一个量级且是所有漏斗指标的关键，采样率要保守；加购与成交量小，不采样。经验比例是曝光 : 点击 : 加购约为 100 : 10 : 1 的事件量，而采样率如果反向设为 1% : 10% : 100%，三者的最终保留量就接近 1 : 1 : 1，这对漏斗分析是有利的——四层的样本量可比，连乘时的方差不会因某一层样本过少而爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>按市场分层。</strong> 小市场的数据量天然小，采样率必须更保守甚至不采样。这是 <a href=\"../query-product-insights/per-market-compare\">分市场/语言对比看板</a> 里「小市场方差大」的成因之一——采样会放大它。因此采样率配置应当<strong>按市场的流量量级自动分档</strong>，而不是一个全局常数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E[事件流] --&gt; S1{查询频次分档}&#10;    S1 --&gt;|头部查询| S2[低采样率 1-5%]&#10;    S1 --&gt;|中部查询| S3[中采样率 20-50%]&#10;    S1 --&gt;|尾部查询| S4[全量 100%]&#10;    S2 --&gt; T1{事件类型补偿}&#10;    S3 --&gt; T1&#10;    S4 --&gt; T1&#10;    T1 --&gt;|曝光| T2[乘采样权重]&#10;    T1 --&gt;|点击| T3[较小补偿]&#10;    T1 --&gt;|加购成交| T4[不采样]&#10;    T2 --&gt; W[写入加权因子列]&#10;    T3 --&gt; W&#10;    T4 --&gt; W&#10;    W --&gt; A[分析侧按权重聚合]\">graph TD\n    E[事件流] --&gt; S1{查询频次分档}\n    S1 --&gt;|头部查询| S2[低采样率 1-5%]\n    S1 --&gt;|中部查询| S3[中采样率 20-50%]\n    S1 --&gt;|尾部查询| S4[全量 100%]\n    S2 --&gt; T1{事件类型补偿}\n    S3 --&gt; T1\n    S4 --&gt; T1\n    T1 --&gt;|曝光| T2[乘采样权重]\n    T1 --&gt;|点击| T3[较小补偿]\n    T1 --&gt;|加购成交| T4[不采样]\n    T2 --&gt; W[写入加权因子列]\n    T3 --&gt; W\n    T4 --&gt; W\n    W --&gt; A[分析侧按权重聚合]</pre><p><strong>权重必须落库。</strong> 采样后每条记录要携带它的采样权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，聚合时用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum w_i x_i / \\sum w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而不是简单平均。这是采样分析里最常见的错误：采样了却按未采样的方式聚合，得到的是有偏结果。权重列也让「事后重新加权」成为可能（例如发现某个分层的权重配置错了，可以只重算权重而不重跑采集）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重与事件合并-不损失精度的手段\">去重与事件合并：不损失精度的手段</h2><p>去重与合并是<strong>无损</strong>的成本控制，应该优先于采样。</p>\n<p><strong>端到端去重。</strong> 同一 <code>event_id</code> 因重试、MQ 重复投递、回填重叠而出现多次，在管道入口按 <code>event_id</code> 去重（幂等消费）。这部分重复通常有 1%~5%，去掉它不损失任何信息。</p>\n<p><strong>曝光合并（impression rollup）。</strong> 曝光事件可以在客户端做细粒度合并：同一次搜索请求内，同一商品的多次曝光（用户滚上去又滚下来）可以合并为一条记录并携带 <code>impression_count</code>。这能把曝光事件量降 20%~40%，且信息损失极小——大多数分析只关心「该商品在这次请求里是否被曝光」，而不是被曝光了几次。需要保留次数的分析（曝光频次与点击率的关系）用 <code>impression_count</code> 字段即可。合并的边界必须是请求级，跨请求合并会破坏 <code>request_id</code> 的语义。</p>\n<p><strong>字段精简。</strong> 曝光事件不需要携带商品标题、价格、图片等可关联信息，只需要 <code>item_id</code>。冗余字段既增加存储又增加不一致的风险（商品改价后，历史曝光事件里的价格是过期快照——除非明确要分析「曝光时的价格」，否则不该存）。把可关联字段留给下游 join，是列式存储下的标准做法，也显著降低压缩后的字节数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高基数-真正的成本杀手\">高基数：真正的成本杀手</h2><p>基数是「一个维度有多少不同取值」。查询串、用户 ID、<code>request_id</code> 的基数都可以是百万到十亿级。高基数对成本的影响不在存储而在<strong>聚合</strong>：按高基数维度 group by 会让结果集爆炸，按高基数维度建索引会让索引比数据还大。</p>\n<p>三个处理手段。</p>\n<p><strong>预聚合与物化。</strong> 分析不需要随时按任意维度组合，而是有固定的几套下钻路径。因此可以在管道里按预设的维度组合（<code>market × intent × device × day</code>）做预聚合，分析侧只查预聚合表。代价是失去灵活性——但那个灵活性 90% 的时间用不上。预聚合表通常比明细小两到三个数量级。</p>\n<p><strong>近似算法。</strong> 需要「不同用户数」「不同查询数」这类去重计数时，用 HyperLogLog 一类的近似基数估计（该算法由 Flajolet 等人于 2007 年提出；Redis 的 HLL 实现用固定 12KB、标准误差 0.81%，可估计至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{64}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的基数；来源：Flajolet et al., &quot;HyperLogLog: the analysis of a near-optimal cardinality estimation algorithm&quot;, AofA 2007, <a href=\"https://algo.inria.fr/flajolet/Publications/FlFuGaMe07.pdf\">https://algo.inria.fr/flajolet/Publications/FlFuGaMe07.pdf</a>；Redis PFCOUNT 文档, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/pfcount/\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/pfcount/</a>）。它的误差可控（典型配置下相对误差 &lt;2%），内存占用是精确去重的百分之一以下。适用判据是：该指标的用途是看趋势与量级，不是做精确核对。UV、独立查询数适合近似；订单量、GMV 这类要进财务口径的绝不能用近似。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>精度代价</th>\n<th>成本收益</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端到端去重</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>去掉 1%~5% 重复</td>\n<td>全部场景，优先做</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光请求级合并</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>减 20%~40% 曝光量</td>\n<td>曝光事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段精简与 join 化</td>\n<td>无（除非需历史快照）</td>\n<td>显著降存储</td>\n<td>全部场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预聚合</td>\n<td>失去任意维度下钻</td>\n<td>结果集小 2~3 个数量级</td>\n<td>固定下钻路径的看板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HyperLogLog 近似</td>\n<td>相对误差 &lt;2%</td>\n<td>内存降至 1% 以下</td>\n<td>趋势类去重计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层采样</td>\n<td>降低有效样本量</td>\n<td>按采样率线性降低</td>\n<td>分母足够大的指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>高基数维度的替代表达。</strong> <code>query_raw</code> 的基数等于不同查询串数量，可达千万级。多数分析不需要原始串——需求分析需要的是 <code>cluster_id</code>（基数低几个数量级，见 <a href=\"../query-product-insights/query-demand-analysis\">查询需求/缺口/趋势分析</a>）。因此明细里存原始串用于长尾排查，报表层一律按 <code>cluster_id</code> 聚合。这与 <a href=\"../experiment-feedback/analytics-privacy\">行为分析的数据合规边界</a> 的要求方向一致：原始查询串属于用户意图表达，越少被长期以可关联形式保留越好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保留期与分层存储\">保留期与分层存储</h2><p>最后的杠杆是保留期。不同数据的时间价值衰减速度差异巨大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>保留期建议</th>\n<th>存储层</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聚合指标（日级）</td>\n<td>3~5 年</td>\n<td>数仓</td>\n<td>长期趋势、同比分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明细事件（曝光级）</td>\n<td>30~90 天</td>\n<td>对象存储/冷层</td>\n<td>故障排查与回填窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话级明细</td>\n<td>6~12 个月</td>\n<td>对象存储</td>\n<td>实验回溯、个案排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始上报（含原始串）</td>\n<td>7~30 天</td>\n<td>热层</td>\n<td>采集缺陷排查，尽快降采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>明细事件的保留期应当与<strong>回填窗口</strong>匹配：如果回填只可能覆盖最近 30 天（因为更早的口径版本已不可重算），那么保留 90 天明细就是在为不可能发生的回填付存储费。反过来，如果合规要求保留 12 个月以备审计，那么保留期由合规决定而不是由成本决定——这类约束必须在上线前定好，而不是在账单出来之后再讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>成本结构由事件条数主导；三个控制点是采样、去重、降基数，其中去重与合并是无损的，应优先做。</li>\n<li>采样的精度代价是分母的有效样本量降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\cdot p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，因此小比率指标（零结果率、分市场分品类）与长尾查询不可均匀采样。</li>\n<li>分层采样按查询频次、事件类型、市场分档；采样权重必须落库，聚合时按权重而非简单平均。</li>\n<li>高基数靠预聚合（牺牲灵活性）、近似算法（牺牲精度）与低基数替代表达（<code>cluster_id</code> 替 <code>query_raw</code>）控制。</li>\n<li>保留期与回填窗口、合规要求对齐；压缩明细保留期是最省事的一笔成本削减。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    N[事件量 N] --&gt; D1[端到端去重 无损]&#10;    D1 --&gt; D2[曝光请求级合并 近无损]&#10;    D2 --&gt; F[字段精简]&#10;    F --&gt; P{还要降吗}&#10;    P --&gt;|否| S[写入明细]&#10;    P --&gt;|是| Q{分母量级}&#10;    Q --&gt;|大 1e8+| L1[低采样率 1-5%]&#10;    Q --&gt;|中 1e5| L2[中采样率 10-50%]&#10;    Q --&gt;|小 长尾| L3[全量保留]&#10;    L1 --&gt; W[携带采样权重]&#10;    L2 --&gt; W&#10;    L3 --&gt; W&#10;    W --&gt; A[按权重聚合]&#10;    A --&gt; R[预聚合表]&#10;    A --&gt; H[HLL 近似去重计数]\">graph TD\n    N[事件量 N] --&gt; D1[端到端去重 无损]\n    D1 --&gt; D2[曝光请求级合并 近无损]\n    D2 --&gt; F[字段精简]\n    F --&gt; P{还要降吗}\n    P --&gt;|否| S[写入明细]\n    P --&gt;|是| Q{分母量级}\n    Q --&gt;|大 1e8+| L1[低采样率 1-5%]\n    Q --&gt;|中 1e5| L2[中采样率 10-50%]\n    Q --&gt;|小 长尾| L3[全量保留]\n    L1 --&gt; W[携带采样权重]\n    L2 --&gt; W\n    L3 --&gt; W\n    W --&gt; A[按权重聚合]\n    A --&gt; R[预聚合表]\n    A --&gt; H[HLL 近似去重计数]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采样、基数与成本控制","id":"采样-基数与成本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成本公式与三个控制点","id":"核心概念-成本公式与三个控制点"},{"level":2,"text":"分层采样：让采样率随需求变化","id":"分层采样-让采样率随需求变化"},{"level":2,"text":"去重与事件合并：不损失精度的手段","id":"去重与事件合并-不损失精度的手段"},{"level":2,"text":"高基数：真正的成本杀手","id":"高基数-真正的成本杀手"},{"level":2,"text":"保留期与分层存储","id":"保留期与分层存储"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时+离线分析管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/event-pipeline/realtime-batch-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"搜索 A/B 的指标与显著性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/experiment-feedback/search-ab-metrics"}}